 "summary": "The three new modules add material that exists nowhere in Mathlib, TauCeti, Physlib, or EpsilonEridani: no restrict-product projection lemma, no integration API for TauCeti's `uniformMeasure`, and no measure-level acceptance-rejection results. Proofs reuse upstream API (`prod_apply`, `withDensity_mul`, `lintegral_strict_mono_of_ae_le_of_ae_lt_on`, `uniformMeasure_eq_smul`, `uniformMeasure_apply`, `integrable_smul_measure`, `ContinuousOn.integrableOn_Icc`) instead of re-deriving it.",
